 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Pick a date, keep it simple, and pick a park with a cafe. Avoid busy weekends and pick a time when there'll be light crowds. Then pick spot in the shade near the cafe, a blanket and a good book for her while you get the food ready. Avoid anything with words and keep it soft. Instrumental music is perfect, especially things like cello or piano. That's lovely, but surprises usually don't work. Keep it simple and don't tell her about it until the morning.",
